<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="66ef2425">&lt;p&gt;
    Include the following elements to outline the main goal, intended audience, timing and plan to execute the survey:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Plan and objectives: 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Business data needs
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Needs addressed by the survey
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Process for collecting data
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Timeline for survey completion
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Survey communication: 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Purpose of survey
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Target audience
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Instructions
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Timeline
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Next steps
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Participant list 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Name
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Job title / role
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Contact information
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
